          {
            "title": "Question: Position",
            "id": 77845,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's wrong with this code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_weekend = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;rise and shine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_weekend:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;stay in bed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    else:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"       ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>else</code> statement should come after the <code>if</code> statement</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>else</code> statement should have a condition</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">There's nothing wrong with the code</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>else</code> statement should come after the <code>if</code> statement.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You want <code>rise and shine</code> to be the fallback when <code>is_weekend</code> is <code>False</code>. Which change makes the code valid?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_weekend = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;rise and shine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_weekend:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;stay in bed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    else:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"       ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Move the <code>else</code> branch after the <code>if</code> branch.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Add a condition after <code>else</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Indent <code>else</code> inside the <code>if</code> code block.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Move the <code>else</code> branch after the <code>if</code> branch.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No own condition",
            "id": 77841,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why doesn't the <code>else</code> statement have its own condition?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Because its condition is the opposite of the <code>if</code> statement's condition</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because it always runs so it doesn't need a condition</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>else</code> statement does have a condition </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Because its condition is the opposite of the <code>if</code> statement's condition.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A program checks <code>if raining</code> before an <code>else</code> branch that suggests sunglasses. When does that fallback branch run?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">When <code>raining</code> is <code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">When <code>raining</code> is <code>True</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Every time, because <code>else</code> has no written condition</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick When <code>raining</code> is <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Catch all",
            "id": 77840,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when <code>common_friends</code> has a value smaller than 3?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>else</code> statement's code block runs</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>if</code> statement's code block runs</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Neither the <code>if</code> block, nor the <code>else</code> statement's code block run</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>else</code> statement's code block runs.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which values of <code>common_friends</code> print <code>Friend suggestions: Sue</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code> and any number above it</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Any number above <code>3</code>, but not <code>3</code> itself</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Any number below <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>3</code> and any number above it.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Lights on",
            "id": 77855,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Choose a value for <code>mad_meter</code> so that the <code>else</code> block runs.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>79</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set up the check on <code>mad_meter</code> and choose its value so the condition is <strong>not</strong> met and the code prints <code>Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>79</code>, followed by <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
