            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"choice = \" /><text value=\"&quot;eclair&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" choice == \" /><text value=\"&quot;crème brûlée&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have chosen ... wisely&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have chosen ... poorly&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You have chosen ... poorly\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>You have chosen ... poorly</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>You have chosen ... wisely</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nothing </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>You have chosen ... poorly</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which change would make this code print <code>You have chosen ... wisely</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"choice = \" /><text value=\"&quot;eclair&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" choice == \" /><text value=\"&quot;crème brûlée&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have chosen ... wisely&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have chosen ... poorly&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You have chosen ... poorly\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Setting <code>choice</code> to <code>\"crème brûlée\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Setting <code>choice</code> to <code>\"crème\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Changing <code>==</code> to <code>=</code> in the <code>if</code> line</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Setting <code>choice</code> to <code>\"crème brûlée\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
