          {
            "title": "Question: Adding elif",
            "id": 78075,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperature = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brr...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's freezing!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's cold out.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's cold out.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>It's cold out.</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>It's freezing!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Brr...</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>It's cold out.</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which value of <code>temperature</code> would make this code display <code>It's freezing!</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperature = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brr...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's freezing!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's cold out.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's cold out.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78079,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The indentation of <code>print(\"My favorite color!\")</code> is different in the first <code>if</code> block compared to the second.</p><p>This code gives an <code>IndentationError</code>. Which <code>if</code> block causes it?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blue is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Green is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(&quot;My favorite color!&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                               ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>\"blue\"</code> block, as the second <code>print()</code>'s indentation is different from both the other <code>print()</code>, and the <code>if</code>, so the computer doesn't understand where it belongs</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>\"green\"</code> block, as the second <code>print()</code> is indented like the <code>if</code> keyword</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Both of them</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>\"blue\"</code> block, as the second <code>print()</code>'s indentation is different from both the other <code>print()</code>, and the <code>if</code>, so the computer doesn't understand where it belongs.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You may edit only the <code>print(\"My favorite color!\")</code> line in the <code>\"blue\"</code> branch.</p><p>Which change fixes the error and keeps that line inside the branch?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blue is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Green is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(&quot;My favorite color!&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                               ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indent it to match <code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Move it left to align with the <code>if</code> line.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Indent it farther than <code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indent it to match <code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78601,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add another <code>elif</code> statement that runs if <code>hours</code> is greater than <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hours = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &lt;= \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Occasional app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moderate app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frequent app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moderate app use\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>elif</code>, followed by <code>hours &gt; 5</code>, and finally <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a final branch that runs when <code>hours</code> is greater than <code>5</code>, so this run prints <code>Frequent app use</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Occasional app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moderate app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frequent app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hours &gt; 7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Frequent app use\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>elif</code>, followed by <code>hours &gt; 5</code>, and finally <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Adding elif",
            "id": 78600,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the <code>elif</code> condition to display <code>Gracias</code> if <code>language</code> is <code>\"Spanish\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"language = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spanish&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;English&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Thank you&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spanish&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gracias&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;German&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Danke&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Gracias&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Gracias\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>elif</code> followed by <code>language</code> and then <code>==</code>, <code>\"Spanish\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Build the middle branch, both its condition and its message, so that when <code>language</code> equals <code>\"Spanish\"</code>, the code prints <code>Gracias</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"language = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spanish&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;English&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Thank you&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spanish&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gracias&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;German&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Danke&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"134\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;German&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Danke&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Gracias\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>elif</code>, followed by <code>language</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>\"Spanish\"</code>, and finally <code>\"Gracias\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
