            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when all conditions linked with <code>or</code> are <code>False</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The code block gets skipped</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The code block runs</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">We need to link at least one <code>True</code> condition</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The code block gets skipped.</p></body></html>",
