            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which part of the combined condition makes the message display?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"read = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"time_elapsed = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" read \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" time_elapsed &gt; \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't delete the message&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Can't delete the message\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>time_elapsed &gt; 30</code>, because <code>50</code> is greater than <code>30</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>read</code>, because a variable name is always <code>True</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Both parts, because <code>or</code> requires every condition to be <code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>time_elapsed &gt; 30</code>, because <code>50</code> is greater than <code>30</code>.</p></body></html>"
